          "path": "_m/c/2/3/p/suzzallo-library-wp/anne-gould-hauberg-artist-imag.jpg",
          "filename": "Anne Gould Hauberg Artist Images Award 2007 - 01.jpg",
          "caption": "Presentation of University of Washington's Anne Gould Hauberg Artist Images Award 2007. (Suzzallo Library, Room 101.) First row (left to right): Jerry Anderson, Nordic Studies Librarian, founder of the award; Anne Gould Hauberg; Betsy Wilson, Dean of University of Washington Libraries; George Suyama, architect, winner of 2004 award. Second row (left to right): Trimpin, sculptor / musician, winner of 2007 award; Woodruff Sullivan, astronomer (and designer of sundials), winner of 1995 award; Patti Warashina, sculptor, winner of 2005 award; Dennis Evans, multi-media artist and Nancy Mee, glass artist, co-winners of 2002 award.",
          "alt": "Presentation of University of Washington's Anne Gould Hauberg Artist Images Award 2007. (Suzzallo Library, Room 101.) First row (left to right): Jerry Anderson, Nordic Studies Librarian, founder of the award; Anne Gould Hauberg; Betsy Wilson, Dean of University of Washington Libraries; George Suyama, architect, winner of 2004 award. Second row (left to right): Trimpin, sculptor / musician, winner of 2007 award; Woodruff Sullivan, astronomer (and designer of sundials), winner of 1995 award; Patti Warashina, sculptor, winner of 2005 award; Dennis Evans, multi-media artist and Nancy Mee, glass artist, co-winners of 2002 award.",
